  (text "R7 + RVX2 with C8: 22.6 kHz (Filter 0) to 334 Hz (Filter 100)\nwith the pedal's 3.3 nF: 32.2 kHz to 475 Hz" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45.72 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8287676b-3b67-5976-a8f3-04b550afd67a"))
  (text "C9 with R8: 7.23 Hz" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 104.14 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "89e7ea61-d91f-5d37-84f4-1da47587e4a9"))
  (text "Section 6 of the circuit notes: a first-order passive low-pass, R7 1.5 kOhm [6] and the A100K Filter pot [6] (a rheostat) into a\ncapacitor to ground.\nC8 is 4.7 nF here (chosen, for bass); the pedal's is 3.3 nF [6], so the range moves from the values above to 334 Hz to 22.6 kHz.\nRVX2 has a log law, as in the DSP (chosen). C9 and R8 are the pedal's output coupling [6], about 0.02 dB at the 120 Hz crossover;\nthe DSP has no counterpart. The JFET output buffer and the Volume pot that follow are not modelled; the Level stage replaces them." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cfe3fb86-96c9-52ba-9d01-5121bf516eb0"))
